{% comment %}
  LURVOX Consistency League — full marketing page section.
  Template: templates/page.league.json
{% endcomment %}

<section class="lx-league" id="consistency-league">
  <div class="lx-league__atmosphere" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="lx-league__hero">
    <a class="lx-league__back" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">← Go back</a>
    <p class="lx-league__brand">LURVOX</p>
    <p class="lx-league__eyebrow">Consistency League</p>
    <h1 class="lx-league__title">
      Show up.<br>
      Climb the ladder.<br>
      <span>Win what others only talk about.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="lx-league__lede">
      Every day you track. Every week you check in. Every photo you upload.
      That consistency is scored — and the top performers walk away with certificates,
      physical trophies, and prize money up to <strong>₹5,000</strong>.
      League entry is free with every coaching plan. Crazy League — the prize-money tiers —
      opens only on the <strong>12-month plan</strong>.
    </p>
    <div class="lx-league__hero-cta">
      <a class="lx-league__btn lx-league__btn--primary" href="/pages/compare-fit?view=compare-short">Start coaching &amp; enter the league</a>
      <a class="lx-league__btn lx-league__btn--ghost" href="#how-it-works">See how winning works</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="lx-league__strip" aria-label="Reward highlights">
    <div class="lx-league__strip-item">
      <span class="lx-league__strip-kicker">League entry</span>
      <span class="lx-league__strip-value">Free with every plan</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lx-league__strip-item">
      <span class="lx-league__strip-kicker">Prize money</span>
      <span class="lx-league__strip-value">Up to ₹5,000</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lx-league__strip-item">
      <span class="lx-league__strip-kicker">Crazy League</span>
      <span class="lx-league__strip-value">12-month plan only</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lx-league__strip-item">
      <span class="lx-league__strip-kicker">Promotion rule</span>
      <span class="lx-league__strip-value">Top 10% monthly</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="lx-league__block" id="how-it-works">
    <p class="lx-league__section-label">How the game works</p>
    <h2 class="lx-league__section-title">Consistency is the currency.</h2>
    <p class="lx-league__section-copy">
      This is not a one-day challenge. It is a monthly ladder inside your coaching app —
      scored from the same habits that transform your body. Miss days, fall behind.
      Stay locked in, and the ladder pays you back.
    </p>
    <ol class="lx-league__steps">
      <li>
        <span class="lx-league__step-num">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Log the work that matters</h3>
          <p>Daily trackers, weekly check-ins, progress photos, and streaks feed your score. No gimmicks — just proof you showed up.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="lx-league__step-num">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Rank inside your coach’s squad</h3>
          <p>You compete with real clients under the same coach. Pressure stays healthy. Accountability stays personal.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="lx-league__step-num">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Top 10% promote every month</h3>
          <p>Finish in the promotion zone and you climb a division. Finish lower and you stay hungry for the next season.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="lx-league__step-num">04</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Collect rewards as you rise</h3>
          <p>Certificates early. Trophies higher. Prize money — up to ₹5,000 — at the Crazy tiers for 12-month members. Consistency becomes a career of wins.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="lx-league__block lx-league__block--ladder">
    <p class="lx-league__section-label">The ladder</p>
    <h2 class="lx-league__section-title">Eight divisions. One obsession: showing up.</h2>
    <div class="lx-league__ladder">
      <article class="lx-league__tier">
        <span class="lx-league__tier-name">Bronze → Silver → Gold</span>
        <span class="lx-league__tier-reward">Virtual certificates</span>
        <p>Build the habit. Earn recognition. Prove you can win the month before you chase hardware.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lx-league__tier lx-league__tier--hot">
        <span class="lx-league__tier-name">Platinum → Diamond</span>
        <span class="lx-league__tier-reward">Physical trophies</span>
        <p>Elite consistency. A trophy on your shelf — not a digital badge that disappears in a feed.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lx-league__tier lx-league__tier--prize">
        <span class="lx-league__tier-name">Crazy 1 → Crazy 2 → Crazy 3</span>
        <span class="lx-league__tier-reward">Prize money up to ₹5,000 · 12-month plan</span>
        <p>
          The sharp end of the ladder. Top performers take home real cash for ruthless consistency —
          reserved for members on the 12-month plan. Shorter plans still climb free through Diamond for certificates and trophies.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="lx-league__tier lx-league__tier--soon">
        <span class="lx-league__tier-name">World Leaderboard</span>
        <span class="lx-league__tier-reward">Coming soon</span>
        <p>After Crazy 3, a global board is coming — so the most consistent athletes compete beyond their squad.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lx-league__block">
    <p class="lx-league__section-label">Why this hits different</p>
    <h2 class="lx-league__section-title">Most apps ask you to stay consistent.<br>We pay attention when you do.</h2>
    <div class="lx-league__grid">
      <div>
        <h3>Rewards tied to real coaching behavior</h3>
        <p>Points come from trackers, check-ins, and photos — the exact behaviors your coach needs to transform you.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Monthly seasons, not vague goals</h3>
        <p>Every month resets the scoreboard. Fresh pressure. Fresh shot at promotion. Fresh chance at prizes.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Status you can feel</h3>
        <p>Certificates. Trophies. Cash up to ₹5,000. The kind of wins that make skipping a day feel expensive.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Built into coaching — not an upsell</h3>
        <p>
          Consistency League entry comes free with every LURVOX plan — no premium league fee.
          Crazy League (prize money up to ₹5,000) is the one exception: it requires the 12-month plan.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lx-league__block" id="crazy-eligibility">
    <p class="lx-league__section-label">Eligibility</p>
    <h2 class="lx-league__section-title">Free to climb. Earned to cash in.</h2>
    <p class="lx-league__section-copy">
      Every coaching member can enter the Consistency League and compete for certificates and trophies —
      Bronze through Diamond. When the ladder reaches Crazy, the stakes become prize money up to ₹5,000.
      That arena is reserved for athletes who commit to the year: the 12-month plan. No shortcuts. No side door.
    </p>
    <div class="lx-league__grid">
      <div>
        <h3>All plans</h3>
        <p>Free Consistency League entry. Climb monthly. Earn certificates and physical trophies with your coach’s squad.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>12-month plan</h3>
        <p>Everything above — plus eligibility for Crazy League, where top finishers can win prize money up to ₹5,000.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lx-league__hero-cta" style="margin-top: 28px;">
      <a class="lx-league__btn lx-league__btn--primary" href="/pages/compare-fit?view=compare-short">Compare plans</a>
      <a class="lx-league__btn lx-league__btn--ghost" href="https://app.lurvox.in/plans/12-months">Go for the 12-month plan</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lx-league__finale">
    <p class="lx-league__brand lx-league__brand--sm">LURVOX</p>
    <h2>The body changes when the habits stick.<br>The league makes sticking worth it.</h2>
    <p>
      Join coaching. Enter the Consistency League free. Climb for certificates and trophies —
      and if you take the 12-month plan, compete in Crazy League for prize money up to ₹5,000 —
      while a real coach builds your plan around you.
    </p>
    <a class="lx-league__btn lx-league__btn--primary" href="/pages/compare-fit?view=compare-short">Choose your plan</a>
  </section>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');

  .lx-league {
    --lx-bg: #070707;
    --lx-ink: #f4f0ea;
    --lx-muted: rgba(244, 240, 234, 0.68);
    --lx-line: rgba(244, 240, 234, 0.12);
    --lx-accent: #ff6200;
    --lx-accent-soft: rgba(255, 98, 0, 0.16);
    --lx-gold: #d6b36a;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--lx-bg);
    color: var(--lx-ink);
    font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .lx-league__atmosphere {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% -10%, rgba(255, 98, 0, 0.22), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 40% at 100% 20%, rgba(214, 179, 106, 0.08), transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #0c0c0c 0%, #070707 40%, #050505 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .lx-league__hero,
  .lx-league__strip,
  .lx-league__block,
  .lx-league__finale {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .lx-league__hero {
    padding: clamp(72px, 12vw, 140px) 0 clamp(48px, 8vw, 80px);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .lx-league__back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: rgba(244, 240, 234, 0.72);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .lx-league__back:hover {
    color: var(--lx-accent);
  }

  .lx-league__brand {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 0.95;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .lx-league__brand--sm {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .lx-league__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lx-accent);
  }

  .lx-league__title {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    max-width: 16ch;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 7.5vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .lx-league__title span {
    color: var(--lx-gold);
  }

  .lx-league__lede {
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    max-width: 42rem;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--lx-muted);
  }

  .lx-league__lede strong {
    color: var(--lx-ink);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lx-league__hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .lx-league__btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 220ms ease, background 220ms ease, color 220ms ease, border-color 220ms ease;
  }

  .lx-league__btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .lx-league__btn--primary {
    background: var(--lx-accent);
    color: #111;
    border: 1px solid var(--lx-accent);
  }

  .lx-league__btn--primary:hover {
    background: #ff7a26;
  }

  .lx-league__btn--ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--lx-ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--lx-line);
  }

  .lx-league__btn--ghost:hover {
    border-color: rgba(244, 240, 234, 0.35);
  }

  .lx-league__strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(56px, 10vw, 96px);
    background: var(--lx-line);
    border: 1px solid var(--lx-line);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .lx-league__strip-item {
    padding: 22px 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  }

  .lx-league__strip-kicker {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lx-muted);
  }

  .lx-league__strip-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .lx-league__block {
    padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 10vw, 100px);
  }

  .lx-league__section-label {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lx-accent);
  }

  .lx-league__section-title {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    max-width: 18ch;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .lx-league__section-copy {
    margin: 0 0 36px;
    max-width: 40rem;
    color: var(--lx-muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .lx-league__steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--lx-line);
  }

  .lx-league__steps > li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 26px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lx-line);
  }

  .lx-league__step-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--lx-gold);
  }

  .lx-league__steps h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lx-league__steps p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--lx-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .lx-league__ladder {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .lx-league__tier {
    padding: 28px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--lx-line);
    background:
      linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04), transparent 55%),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }

  .lx-league__tier--hot {
    border-color: rgba(214, 179, 106, 0.35);
  }

  .lx-league__tier--prize {
    border-color: rgba(255, 98, 0, 0.45);
    background:
      linear-gradient(160deg, var(--lx-accent-soft), transparent 60%),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }

  .lx-league__tier--soon {
    opacity: 0.88;
  }

  .lx-league__tier-name {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .lx-league__tier-reward {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--lx-line);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lx-accent);
  }

  .lx-league__tier p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--lx-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .lx-league__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 28px 36px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .lx-league__grid h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lx-league__grid p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--lx-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .lx-league__finale {
    padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 110px) 0 clamp(80px, 12vw, 140px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--lx-line);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .lx-league__finale h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    max-width: 18ch;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .lx-league__finale p {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    max-width: 38rem;
    color: var(--lx-muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .lx-league__strip,
    .lx-league__ladder,
    .lx-league__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lx-league__strip,
    .lx-league__ladder,
    .lx-league__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .lx-league__steps > li {
      grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .lx-league__hero-cta {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .lx-league__hero,
    .lx-league__strip,
    .lx-league__block,
    .lx-league__finale {
      animation: lx-league-rise 700ms ease both;
    }

    .lx-league__strip { animation-delay: 80ms; }
    .lx-league__block { animation-delay: 120ms; }
    .lx-league__finale { animation-delay: 160ms; }
  }

  @keyframes lx-league-rise {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(18px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "LURVOX Consistency League",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-lurvox-league",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "LURVOX Consistency League"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
